# Git LFS template cho file lon (>50MB / >100MB).
# Mac dinh pipeline da toi uu MP3 64kbps mono (<20MB/file) de GitHub Pages phuc vu truc tiep ma khong can LFS.
# Neu ban bo sung file WAV/MP4 >50MB, bo dau '#' o cac dong duoi va chay:
#   git lfs install
#   git lfs track "public/data/**/*.mp4" "public/data/**/*.wav"
#
# *.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.wav filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.m4a filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
